## Attribution Note

**SwarmCraft** is an educational course-demo documentation project built around the
open-source project **HKUDS/Vibe-Trading** ("Vibe-Trading: Your Personal Trading Agent",
https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading), which is released under the **MIT License**.

This repository contains no Vibe-Trading source code — it is a documentation-only course
package (analysis reports, reproduction plan, course design, and LLM provider guidance)
that references and describes Vibe-Trading for teaching purposes. Any Vibe-Trading code or
documentation quoted or referenced herein remains under the original Vibe-Trading MIT
license terms and copyright.

For the original Vibe-Trading license, see:
https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/LICENSE
